<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
  <!--
    Debug-configuration entitlements, used by the dev-client builds (development
    and dev-physical archive with -configuration Debug). Release keeps
    BSVBrowser.entitlements.

    Now byte-identical to Release: the split existed only because
    com.apple.developer.web-browser could not appear in Debug (Expo mints an
    AdHoc profile without the Default Web Browser capability, and Xcode refuses
    to archive). That entitlement was dropped from the app entirely in favour of
    the BLE local-payment rung, which cannot coexist with it — linking
    CoreBluetooth makes ITMS-90683 demand NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription, and
    that purpose string is one of the seven that get a browser-entitled app
    rejected. Kept as a separate file because the Xcode project references it
    per-configuration; collapse it only alongside a pbxproj change.

    NFC reader-session formats MUST stay — that is the YubiKey transport on iOS,
    so dropping it here would break the vault ceremony this build exists to test.
  -->
  <dict>
    <key>com.apple.developer.nfc.readersession.formats</key>
    <array>
      <string>TAG</string>
    </array>
  </dict>
</plist>
